  m_text: "Full Privacy Policy\n\nLast Updated: May 13, 2025\n\nThis Privacy Policy
    explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights related to that
    data.\n\nWhen you play our game, we may collect the following types of data through
    Unity Services Analytics:\n - Device information: Device type, operating system
    version\n - Gameplay data: Session start/end times, duration, level progress,
    in-game actions (e.g., buttons pressed)\n - Region information: General location
    based on IP address (e.g., country or region)\n - Crash and error reports: Technical
    information to help us diagnose and fix bugs\n\nNote: We do not collect your
    name, email address, phone number, or other directly identifying personal information.\nWe
    use the collected data to understand how the game is played, identify and fix
    bugs or crashes, and improve game features and balance.\n\nWe use Unity Technologies
    to collect and analyze gameplay data. Unity acts as a data processor on our behalf.
    You can view Unity\u2019s Privacy Policy here.\n\nWe do not use this data to
    track users for advertising or sell it to third parties.\n\nYou have the right
    to withdraw consent at any time through the Main Menu Options."
